Error [jet.ReadOnlyValueNotOwned]: `f` was not moved here, so it cannot be returned as-is
  --> tests/ui/ownership/plain_parameter_write_take_and_escape_diagnostics_name_explicit_access_3.jet:2:58
    |
  2 | keep: fn(f: fn(Int) -> Int) -[]> fn(Int) -> Int { return f }
    |                                                          ^
 Why: This function has read access only and does not own the value
 Fix: Return a copy: `return f.copy()` — or take ownership with the move marker `^`: `f: ^fn(Int) -> Int`. To return borrowed data, declare `-> View<T> from f` and return a view derived from `f`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0120
